---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Mare Punzalan — Astro Wild Child">
  <section class="container-awc py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[color:var(--gold)] mb-6">About</div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05]">Mare Punzalan</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[color:var(--ink-soft)] italic font-serif">Astrologer, cartographer of inner geography, keeper of wild edges.</p>

      <div class="prose-awc mt-14 mx-0 max-w-none">
        <p>Toronto-based astrologer with <strong>over two decades of client work</strong> — a medley of evolutionary, psychological, and predictive astrology, with a particular focus on AstroCartoGraphy. My practice grew from the consulting room, not the classroom: every framework, every screen, every tool I use exists because a real session needed it.</p>
        <h2>How I read a chart</h2>
        <p>Ascendant and its ruler first. Then the Sun and the Moon, and the relationship between the three. Houses, dignity, the shape of the chart, the balance of elements. Only then do I zoom into what brought you to me — love, direction, timing, a decision you can't seem to make.</p>
        <h2>Beyond the reading</h2>
        <p>I write, I publish, and I co-designed <a href="/astrodesk">Astrodesk</a> — the professional desk I wished I had at my own consulting table. It's built for practitioners who want the chart, the transits and the map ready when a client sits down.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 flex gap-4">
        <a href="/work-with-me" class="btn btn-primary">Work with me</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Say hi</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
